LowOnStock ;pos
⍝ Finds products with low stock levels and shows the required refill quantity.

pos ← (Quantity≤30)/⍳⍴Quantity

:If (⍴pos)<1
⎕←'Items are enough stacked!'

:Else
{
⎕←'---------------------'
⎕←'Item low on stock: ' , ItemName[⍵]
⎕←' Quantity: ' , Quantity[⍵]
⎕← 'Need to be refilled with at least: ' , (31 - Quantity[⍵])
⎕←'---------------------'
}¨pos
:EndIf
